2oBQniaLuvTS8GDWyeHvjf5DQjz4GtEgtuHGQ&oe=6B05BB4D"}, "display_name": "Ufence", "keywords": ["Fencing", "Epee", "Sword", "Duel", "Blade"], "long_description": "UFence is a Mixed Reality fencing and sword-fighting trainer built for real skill development, fitness, and immersive practice. Train epee-style blade control with responsive physics and structured drills that help you improve timing, distance, and technique.\n\nChoose from guided lessons, free-practice modes, and challenge routines that build coordination and confidence. UFence blends real fencing principles with VR training tools, so you can work on footwork, reactions, and blade actions in a safe and controlled environment. Take on a robot opponent in sword duels and test what you've learned.\n\nUse passthrough to fence inside your own space, or switch to immersive arenas for focused training. Whether you're new to fencing, a sword-fighting or martial arts fan, or an experienced fencer looking to sharpen your skills, Ufence offers a fun, active way to learn, move, and improve you sword-fighting abilities!", "short_description": "VR and Mixed Reality fencing and sword-fighting trainer. Practice epee-style blade control, footwork and timing through guided lessons, free practice and sword duels, and save your own immersive routines."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ufencevr.com/general-5", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hugo Veryzer", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ufencevr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "re